WEBVTT

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.000
Huh, lightning?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.910
What was that at such an hour?!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.290
Hey, Baby Beel...

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.370
You like scary things, right?

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.870
Take a look at this.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.550
Oh, I know.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.710
Peek a...

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:29.750
...boo!

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:32.530
All right! This is it!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.720
Peek a...

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.630
...boo!

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.410
What are you trying to do, scare him?

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:40.640
Sis!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.270
What's with the sneak attack?!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.010
What are you showin' him?

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.540
Baby Beel's crying!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.220
You idiot!

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.100
Baby Beel likes this sort of...

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.670
Run for it, Sis!

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.300
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.520
through some strange 
circumstances, is raising a baby.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:07.150
However that baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.340
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:55.020
<b>You won't get to sleep tonight</b>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.210
What is wrong with him?!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.820
This has been going on three days straight!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.530
It is clearly a case of night crying.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.090
Night crying?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.430
What are you so worried about?

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.500
It's a natural thing, not unlike 
the occasional wetting of the bed.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.750
Previously, during his 
periods of night crying,

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.500
the sound was so great the people of the 
surrounding countries could not withstand it,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.000
and came begging, "We'll pledge our 
obedience, just make it stop, please!"

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:24.310
Well, <i>I</i> can't stand it anymore!

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:27.640
One who is to be a parent should be able 
to withstand a little night crying.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.390
Get off your high horse!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.190
His night crying ain't your normal version!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.400
And, look outside!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.360
Oga-san, this is a problem.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.280
Can't you do something?

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.700
Me? Do something?

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.720
I understand.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.250
I can do only this!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.700
Sliding...

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.360
...Grovel!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.170
I am so very sorry!

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.150
I apologize from the bottom of my heart!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.420
What beautiful groveling form!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.700
My heart is being healed...

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.590
Thank goodness...

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.060
With this, everything will be right as...

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.100
I don't think so, buddy!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.600
We told you he's too damn loud!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.180
I'm sorry!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:21.300
We're gonna get kicked out 
of the house at this rate.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:23.900
That won't do.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:27.200
The Master has just gotten 
used to this place, after all.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.000
How about I take on the whiners 
and quickly silence them?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.510
Hold it, hold it!

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.830
Don't make things more difficult 
than they already are!

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.130
Anyway, how can I stop him from night crying?

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:48.930
Fundamentally, you need to get him 
to relax before putting him to sleep.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.560
Then...

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.340
How about this?

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.700
A bath?

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:56.810
But, you see...

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.120
What?

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:04.480
Once, when the Great Demon Lord stayed sitting 
too long playing games and developed back pain...

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.820
He took the Master with him to the 
Magma Valley for some therapy, but...

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:11.260
59!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.060
60!

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:16.030
Got it? Until 100...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.340
Wait... What was I at again?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:20.880
Ah well, I'll start back at the beginning!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:28.340
1, 2, 3, 4, 5...

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:33.180
Ever since, the Master has had a deep 
hatred of being soaked in hot water.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.830
This Great Demon Lord of yours 
is screwed up, you know?

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:40.010
Anyway, I get it. "Don't stick 
him in the bathtub", right?

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.930
Hey, is he shaking?

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:50.280
Master, it's okay.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.910
It'll be fine! It's not hot...

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.040
Why, you...

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.630
Baby Beel!

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:06.060
Cut it out!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.090
As you can tell, the bath 
time plan was a failure.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:33.890
But seriously, we're in trouble 
if this night crying continues.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.460
What's the usual thing to do for this?

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:40.960
It's easy enough to tell when they're crying 
because they're hungry or wet themselves...

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:44.350
But for Beel-chan, it's not so clear-cut.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:47.690
I guess the obvious thing would be to 
play with him a bunch during the day

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.170
and tire him out so he 
sleeps soundly at night.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:55.910
Well, it's Sunday, so why 
don't we all play with him?

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.230
It's not like you have 
anything to do either, Dad.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.200
Why are you just assuming that?!

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.230
What does Baby Beel like?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.610
Let me see...

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:08.110
He's royalty, so he prefers a 
position of overwhelming power.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.060
Ah, he wants to feel powerful.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.240
Then leave that to me!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.260
P-Pops...

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:20.710
I will be his horse and let Beel-chan 
feel what it's like to be a king!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.880
Now, Beel-chan, onto my back!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.580
No...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.500
Master, you're very gallant.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.950
Your tea will get cold.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.390
Beel-chan didn't even smile...

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:39.060
I guess Dad's better than Grandpa, after all.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.310
Damn it... Why do I have to do this?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.000
Stop complaining.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.480
We have to entertain the Master.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.310
Come now, hurry up and move!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:50.240
Why you...

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.370
Just you wait until his night crying stops!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.660
Hey. Speed up!

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.090
The Master is getting bored.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.770
If that happens, what is the point?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.750
God damn it!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.260
He likes it.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:14.920
This is kind of nice, you know?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.800
It feels like "family".

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.540
All the women in my family...

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.530
He said "Full speed ahead," I believe.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.150
Now, go!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.840
Pitiful.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.160
And you call yourself his father?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.160
Stop talking like it's nothing!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.790
Do you know how many hours 
I've been on all-fours?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.860
But you must play with him as much 
as you can, or there is no point.

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.120
I-I know!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.480
Wow, look at Dad go!

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:57.970
I learned this for business parties!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.760
How do you like it, Beel-chan?

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.860
Finally, my honored place 
as a grandfather will...

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.070
You want... those?

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.450
He likes it!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.160
Come on, Tatsumi! Don't just 
lay there! Do something.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.830
Look at how hard Dad tried.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.600
Sure, but...

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.340
This is all I got.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.170
Peek a...

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:32.960
...boo!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:36.310
I told you, what's the point in scaring him?!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.720
No! Baby Beel likes this!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.060
Stop spouting nonsense!

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:46.060
Huh? You like this?

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.060
What a funny little guy.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.650
Oh? Worked up an appetite?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.350
Mom, Baby Beel's hungry.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.610
Okay...

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:07.980
What is it now?

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.750
Like the kanji for river (川)...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:14.190
Babies love to sleep snug 
between mother and father!

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.380
Okay, good night, Hilda-chan.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.430
Yes. Good night.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.460
Is this river character some kind of spell?

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:28.070
I don't know if I'd call it a spell...

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.820
It looks like all the playtime 
this afternoon has had its effect.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.830
All right!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.570
Finally.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.080
Bathroom...

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:00.970
What are you doing?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.160
Y-You demon!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.050
Oga-san, a word?!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.950
Can you cut it out already?

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.700
Jumping...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.110
Spin Turn...

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:21.400
Rolling Grovel!

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.120
I'm so super seriously sorry!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.540
Whoa, he spun!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.580
Can you even do that?

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.640
To go so far... Maybe we should...

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:32.470
It got through?

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.990
Truly, the power of 
groveling knows no bounds!

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:37.270
The power of groveling...

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:41.130
My Grovel Power Level has saved 
my family from this crisis!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.070
Did you seriously think we'd forgive you?

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.600
Spinning ain't gonna cut it!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:47.180
We didn't come here to see 
your one-ring circus act!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.360
Must I train to grovel even more penitently?!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.770
Stop talking like it's some sport!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.130
We were so close...

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.400
Thanks to you, it's blown up again!

00:11:58.350 --> 00:11:59.780
Fine, then I have no choice.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.400
There is a toy that the 
Master enjoys, you see...

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.680
If we use that, then perhaps...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.780
If there was something like 
that, get it out here now!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.500
It's in the Demon World!

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:12.090
While I am away, please take 
good care of the Master.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.880
Man...

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.460
Tatsumi!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:20.090
I know, I know!

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.100
Hey...

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.820
It was Baby Beel, yup...

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.350
Are you taking proper care of him?

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:40.260
Do you have any idea how hard it's been?

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.680
I haven't slept in four days!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.430
He ain't that easy to please.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:50.680
He went nuts in the bath with Hilda, and 
wouldn't sleep together with the two of us...

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.230
Wait a sec!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.430
You slept together?!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.250
You took a bath together with Hilda-san?!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.470
No, no...

00:12:56.470 --> 00:13:00.630
You make everyone around lose sleep while 
keeping all the good times to yourself!

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:02.050
I said, that's not it!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.660
Damn it all!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.970
And I've got Mr. Mustache 
crashing at my place!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.800
Shut up all ready!

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.100
I'm tired, man!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.740
I gotta take a nap while 
Baby Beel's asleep...

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:13.060
Wait up!

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:37.930
I'm not getting any closer...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.730
O-Oga?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.800
Is he asleep?

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:48.680
This is...

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.810
I-I did it!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.710
A dream?

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.120
Or maybe...

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.500
Kanzaki-san?

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.010
Hey, Shiroyama...

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.580
We're heading to see Oga.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.710
Huh? Why now, all of a sudden?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.040
I had a vision.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.970
What's the matter, Baby Beel?

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:34.600
Food? Hold on a sec.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.730
H-Hold it!

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.360
I'm sleepy...

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.130
You! Perfect timing.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.270
Come with me!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.270
Huh? H-Hey...

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.740
It's gotta be you!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.000
Where are we going?

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.640
Where else?

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.500
O-Oga-kun!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:06.810
I-I see...

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:09.010
We're getting married!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.890
<b>Park Debut</b>

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.740
Goal!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.420
Madame...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:19.920
Madame Aoi...

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.850
Sorry, I fell asleep.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:27.280
Uh, we were sleeping too, so no worries.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:31.820
But you were thinking about 
Oga again, weren't you?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.170
Of course not!

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:35.780
You were talking in your sleep.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.800
So cute...

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.580
Anyway, I don't approve of him yet.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.710
Don't let your guard down near him.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:49.550
But, he's not dangerous!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:52.720
Do you understand what I'm saying?!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:54.780
I do...

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:02.230
...she says, but I ran into him earlier.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:08.580
Well, I got the wrong idea back then,

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:12.200
but when I think about it, we 
were talking just the two of us.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.950
And it was a pretty good mood, too.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.860
Hey, is it true that "Rampagin' 
Ogre" takes baths with his wife?

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:20.930
Seriously!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:24.210
This morning that guy who's always 
with him was prattling on about it.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.660
His wife's that platinum 
blond bombshell, right?

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.500
I'm so jealous...

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.810
You!

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:34.220
Rampagin' Ogre!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.500
Perfect timing.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.000
Come with me!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.230
Hey, you!

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:43.440
Yogurty's all sold out, and 
the shop lady's asleep.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:44.950
Anyway...

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:52.240
What kind of vision?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.000
Just come with me.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:56.770
Oga should be collapsed 
somewhere around here.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:59.780
You've got to be kidding me!

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.430
W-What was that?

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:08.460
The Queen?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.800
O-Oga?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.820
See? Just like it was in my vision.

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.140
S-Sure...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.850
Shit, what's with her?

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:25.060
Right... Then, I...

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.340
Huh?

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.500
You know how tired out 
I am from lack of sleep?

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.410
What the hell are you doing?!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.910
Uh?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.870
Rampagin' Ogre don't hold back, do he?

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:47.330
I wish he and Tojo would hurry up with it.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.980
No one else is a match...

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.560
So, you're Oga?

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:05.240
I heard I'd get a bonus if 
I beat the crap out of you.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.230
Let's fight.

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.230
Who are you?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.990
Yes... Crush each other!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.280
Crush each other nice and good...

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:23.870
H-Himekawa-san?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.680
What? A dream?

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:30.330
Man, if only they'd beat 
each other up like that...

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.410
He's a wreck!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.620
Did he go at it with Tojo 
just like in my dream?

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.510
If that's the case, then...

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.890
Let's go, you guys! This is our chance!

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:47.420
It has to be now!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.990
Yes, yes... Nice and gentle...

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.240
How do you like it?

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:01.240
You bastards...

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:05.900
Stop comin' out of the woodwork!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.850
Huh? Baby Beel?

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:15.250
Don't pull that!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.160
I'll bring you something soon, really!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.430
<b>Oga</b>

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.430
I'm home...

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.340
Oh, you're back?

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:30.770
How'd it go? Did you bring it back?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.180
Sorry about the trouble.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.350
That toy was nowhere to be found.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.730
I consulted with the Great Demon Lord,

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:41.280
and the way to stop his night crying 
is to take him back to the Demon World.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.930
S-Seriously?

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.010
Your formal thank you will 
come at a later date.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:46.530
H-Hey!

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:52.820
Baby Beel...

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.060
Baby Beel...

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.180
A dream?

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:02.580
Baby Beel...

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.180
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:09.730
Hey Tatsumi, you need to 
put Beel-chan to sleep.

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:12.630
You're a wreck! Did you 
get into a fight again?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:14.890
Not like I started anything...

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.930
For some weird reason 
everyone just came at me...

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.690
Sheesh... You gonna be okay?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:24.070
Maybe I'll have Baby Beel 
sleep with Mom tonight.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:26.840
Look at him. He's getting ready to cry again.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.130
I don't think so.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.530
I'm the only one who can deal with this guy.

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.360
Don't pull that!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.980
Now, go to sleep!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.230
You're back?

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.910
Uh, sure, but what the hell is this?

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:04.360
I told you, it's a toy that 
the Master enjoys, remember?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:11.130
The cries of the Demon 
World's Great Sea Serpent.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:13.370
While its cries ring out...

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.000
It's obviously even louder 
than his night crying!

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.390
W-What was that?

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:22.610
What is it now?

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.680
Hey, Tatsumi!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.900
Don't ask me!

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:31.250
I got nothing to do with this!

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.140
And hey, you! Don't just sleep like a log!

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:09.070
<b>Oga</b>

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:35.510
Master, you mustn't enter there!

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.020
What? You want me to board as well?

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:42.580
Oh, this is actually quite nice.

00:23:48.020 --> 00:23:48.830
A dream?

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:50.150
You?!

00:24:01.900 --> 00:24:04.050
So, what is in store for next week's Beelzebub?

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:06.490
I am Oga Tatsumi's father.

00:24:06.700 --> 00:24:09.450
It's my first preview, so 
I'm a little nervous...

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.140
Ah yes, I suppose I don't have a name yet.

00:24:13.140 --> 00:24:17.010
Even Furuichi-kun's little sister, 
Honoka, has a name...

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:18.710
Oh, right! Next week's Beelzebub:

00:24:18.710 --> 00:24:22.560
Baby Beel's Assessment Test, and 
Hilda: Dear Great Demon Lord.

00:24:22.560 --> 00:24:24.020
It's a two parter.

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:26.370
Please watch next week as well.

00:24:26.370 --> 00:24:27.270
That's all, folks.

00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:28.550
Stop right there!
